# A private clients/ folder at the root, never deployed. Anchored to the root on 2026-10-07: unanchored
# it also hid skills-marketplace/browse/clients/, the store's Sales & clients page.
/clients/
engineer-curriculum.md
# Internal planning docs — never deploy to the public site.
PRICING-ONETIME-MIGRATION.md
# Video masters — keep the full-res original on disk, ship only the optimized web encode.
assets/*.master.mp4
# macOS folder metadata — never track.
.DS_Store
# Headless-browser profiles. Chrome writes these into the working directory when it is run
# without --user-data-dir, and the Pages workflow uploads the repo root verbatim, so a stray
# profile gets served from otianai.com. 44 MB of them shipped on 2026-08-11.
cp[0-9]*/
# Firebase deploy caches and logs. Regenerated on every deploy, machine-local, never shipped.
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log

# scripts/check-csp.py writes this probe into the repo root while a sweep runs and removes
# it after. A crashed or interrupted sweep leaves it behind, where the next check-facts
# run counts it as a served page.
_csp-selftest.html
_site/
scripts/__pycache__/

# Internal docs live in the private Otian-Internal repo. scripts/link-internal.sh links them into
# these paths on a computer and on a deploy, and this keeps the links from being committed here.
/CLAUDE.md
/TRUST.md
/FACTS.md
/WAR-ROOM.md
/HUDSON-DASHBOARD.md
/RESTYLE.md
/SIMPLIFY.md
/BRAND.md
/data/docs-features.json
/.claude/settings.json
